_C0 Unlock Rheairds
_L 0x2014DCF0 0x10400001


;This code only works on the LBP Patch
;
;Resumed Controls
;Square + Select     Enable debug (in main menu), don't need the cheat
;Square + R          Flags
;Square + L          Skits (field) / movies (in maps)
;Cross  + R          Mini-games
;Cross  + L          Encounters
;L                   Battles
;R                   Map warp
;
;Full Explanation
;To enable debug options:
;Go to △ menu and press □+SELECT to cycle the debug modes, either nothing, debug or photo mode
;There's a few menus available in debug mode, the values change with LEFT and RIGHT
;and holding □ makes the counters change in 10s, X leaves the menu and O confirms the values
;
;Now "DEBUG" appears as an option in the title screen
;It takes you to the debug room
;
;Battle Menu:  
;Press L to bring it up
;Allows to start a battle, by selecting a stage and group ID
;
;Map Menu:
;Press R to bring it up
;Allows to teleport to any map ID
;
;Encounter Menu:
;Press X+L to bring it up
;Allows to set next encounter type
;
;Minigame Menu:
;Press X+R to bring it up
;
;Movie Menu:
;Press □+L to bring it up, only works on the 2D maps
;Allows to view any fmv
;
;Skit Menu:
;Press □+L to bring it up, only works on the 3D field
;Allows to view any skit
;
;Flags Menu:
;Press □+R to bring it up
;Allows to set the value of some flags:
;SCEN flag for event processing
;DEMO flag for cutscenes
;FADE as the name says
;WAIT as the name says
;INTER interrupts
;MENU flag for △ menu availability
;
;In Photo mode you can:
;[2D Map] Move the camera, logic will pause and no entities will be rendered
;[3D field] Enable the camera menu with □+SELECT
;
;Moreover, while the debug mode is enabled you can:
;Get some info in the △ menu
;Always eat
;Something about damage (?)
;Skip encounter
;Skip all skits
;Something in sound menu (?)
;See map zones in the mini map
;See the frame counter in the in-game cutscenes
;Always fly
;See the camera lines and coordinates in the overworld
;Ignore collision in the overworld by holding □
;Run faster and ignore collision in the overworld by holding X
;Run faster and ignore collision in the 2d maps by holding □
;Get debug powers when entering a battle
;Do funky stuff in the 2dmaps with L+ARROW
;
;Some of these effects are covered by other debug cheats
_C0 Full Debug Mode
_L 0x0088A0A4 0x00000001


